WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Can one dose of doxycycline after sex prevent STIs?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
DoxyPEP enrolled 501 participants people with a recent bacterial STI.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
In the PrEP cohort, STIs at 10.7% of visits with doxy-PEP versus 31.9% with standard care.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
In people living with HIV: 11.8% versus 30.5%.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Chlamydia relative risk 0.12. Gonorrhea fell less, 0.45.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
Number needed to treat: about 5.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
Doxy-PEP cut bacterial STIs by about two thirds. N Engl J Med, 2023. Scroll for the full breakdown.
